{"key":"InputControlsWindow","text":"## InputControlsWindow\n\nThe **Input Controls Window** is a single-page reference for every keyboard,\nmouse, and interaction control in NOS. It stays open as a persistent\ncheat-sheet while you work.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nControls Reference | 0.50, 0.50 | A scrollable, color-grouped list — Keyboard shortcuts, Mouse & Pointer actions, drag Interactions, in-place Text Editing keys, and Tips. Scroll to browse every group.\n\n---\n\n### What it covers\n\n- **Keyboard** — global shortcuts (reload layout, open UML, close window, toggle this window)\n- **Mouse & Pointer** — click, double-click, right-click, scroll, drag\n- **Interactions** — dragging icons, text, palette items; edge-snapping; Esc behavior\n- **Text Editing** — selection, word-jump, copy / cut / paste in every in-place field\n- **Tips** — the UFOS badge and App Gallery\n\n### Shortcuts\n\n- **Ctrl + I** — toggle this window (it stays persistent)\n\n### Status: Stable\n### Purpose: OS\n\n---","screenshot":""}